[
  {
    "start": "00:00:03.625",
    "end": "00:00:06.044",
    "start_seconds": 3.625,
    "end_seconds": 6.044,
    "text": "When a community wants to build"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:06.044",
    "end": "00:00:10.257",
    "start_seconds": 6.044,
    "end_seconds": 10.257,
    "text": "a bridge or transit system, housing,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:10.257",
    "end": "00:00:11.883",
    "start_seconds": 10.257,
    "end_seconds": 11.883,
    "text": "sustainable infrastructure --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:11.883",
    "end": "00:00:13.635",
    "start_seconds": 11.883,
    "end_seconds": 13.635,
    "text": "where does the money come from?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:14.010",
    "end": "00:00:16.930",
    "start_seconds": 14.01,
    "end_seconds": 16.93,
    "text": "Money ultimately decides what gets built."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:16.972",
    "end": "00:00:18.348",
    "start_seconds": 16.972,
    "end_seconds": 18.348,
    "text": "Money decides what survives."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:18.348",
    "end": "00:00:21.768",
    "start_seconds": 18.348,
    "end_seconds": 21.768,
    "text": "Money decides what future becomes possible."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:21.810",
    "end": "00:00:24.104",
    "start_seconds": 21.81,
    "end_seconds": 24.104,
    "text": "So change where money goes and who controls it --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:24.104",
    "end": "00:00:26.856",
    "start_seconds": 24.104,
    "end_seconds": 26.856,
    "text": "then you change what becomes possible."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:27.566",
    "end": "00:00:28.900",
    "start_seconds": 27.566,
    "end_seconds": 28.9,
    "text": "I'm Trinity Tran,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:28.900",
    "end": "00:00:32.445",
    "start_seconds": 28.9,
    "end_seconds": 32.445,
    "text": "I lead efforts to build public banks in California and beyond."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:32.946",
    "end": "00:00:35.699",
    "start_seconds": 32.946,
    "end_seconds": 35.699,
    "text": "Most of the time, our cities don’t have the money upfront"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:35.740",
    "end": "00:00:40.745",
    "start_seconds": 35.74,
    "end_seconds": 40.745,
    "text": "to be able to pay for a project like a bridge or housing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:40.745",
    "end": "00:00:44.916",
    "start_seconds": 40.745,
    "end_seconds": 44.916,
    "text": "And so they will issue a bond,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:44.916",
    "end": "00:00:47.085",
    "start_seconds": 44.916,
    "end_seconds": 47.085,
    "text": "which is essentially a long-term loan,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:47.085",
    "end": "00:00:50.130",
    "start_seconds": 47.085,
    "end_seconds": 50.13,
    "text": "provided [and] structured by Wall Street banks."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:50.171",
    "end": "00:00:55.010",
    "start_seconds": 50.171,
    "end_seconds": 55.01,
    "text": "A loan is money that is provided upfront and paid back over time with interest."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:55.010",
    "end": "00:00:59.097",
    "start_seconds": 55.01,
    "end_seconds": 59.097,
    "text": "Wall Street banks -- private lenders -- end up tacking on fees"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:59.097",
    "end": "00:01:00.765",
    "start_seconds": 59.097,
    "end_seconds": 60.765,
    "text": "to structure and sell those bonds."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:00.807",
    "end": "00:01:04.102",
    "start_seconds": 60.807,
    "end_seconds": 64.102,
    "text": "Then the reality is that our local governments are not only paying"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:04.144",
    "end": "00:01:05.770",
    "start_seconds": 64.144,
    "end_seconds": 65.77,
    "text": "for the cost of the project,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:05.812",
    "end": "00:01:08.898",
    "start_seconds": 65.812,
    "end_seconds": 68.898,
    "text": "but decades of interest on top of that."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:08.940",
    "end": "00:01:11.651",
    "start_seconds": 68.94,
    "end_seconds": 71.651,
    "text": "So for every dollar that we're borrowing,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:11.693",
    "end": "00:01:15.989",
    "start_seconds": 71.693,
    "end_seconds": 75.989,
    "text": "we're paying another dollar in interest over time, sometimes more."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:16.364",
    "end": "00:01:19.784",
    "start_seconds": 76.364,
    "end_seconds": 79.78399999999999,
    "text": "And that's all money that's going out the door to private lenders."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:19.826",
    "end": "00:01:22.203",
    "start_seconds": 79.826,
    "end_seconds": 82.203,
    "text": "We're paying hundreds of millions of dollars"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:22.245",
    "end": "00:01:23.705",
    "start_seconds": 82.245,
    "end_seconds": 83.705,
    "text": "in the city of Los Angeles."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:23.705",
    "end": "00:01:28.043",
    "start_seconds": 83.705,
    "end_seconds": 88.043,
    "text": "At the state level, in California, we’re paying $4 billion"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:28.084",
    "end": "00:01:30.128",
    "start_seconds": 88.084,
    "end_seconds": 90.128,
    "text": "in interest annually."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:30.170",
    "end": "00:01:33.423",
    "start_seconds": 90.17,
    "end_seconds": 93.423,
    "text": "That's money flowing out of our communities"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:33.465",
    "end": "00:01:35.800",
    "start_seconds": 93.465,
    "end_seconds": 95.8,
    "text": "rather than being invested locally."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:36.468",
    "end": "00:01:39.304",
    "start_seconds": 96.468,
    "end_seconds": 99.304,
    "text": "Private banks are owned by shareholders."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:39.346",
    "end": "00:01:42.098",
    "start_seconds": 99.346,
    "end_seconds": 102.098,
    "text": "They're investing in areas that make them a lot of money,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:42.140",
    "end": "00:01:46.311",
    "start_seconds": 102.14,
    "end_seconds": 106.311,
    "text": "and not necessarily what’s in the best interest of our communities."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:46.311",
    "end": "00:01:48.980",
    "start_seconds": 106.311,
    "end_seconds": 108.97999999999999,
    "text": "Public banking asks a different question:"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:49.022",
    "end": "00:01:52.984",
    "start_seconds": 109.02199999999999,
    "end_seconds": 112.98400000000001,
    "text": "how do we do more with the dollars that our communities generate"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:53.026",
    "end": "00:01:55.362",
    "start_seconds": 113.02600000000001,
    "end_seconds": 115.362,
    "text": "without raising taxes,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:55.403",
    "end": "00:01:58.031",
    "start_seconds": 115.40299999999999,
    "end_seconds": 118.031,
    "text": "but by lowering the cost of financing itself?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:58.365",
    "end": "00:02:01.368",
    "start_seconds": 118.36500000000001,
    "end_seconds": 121.368,
    "text": "A public bank is a bank owned by the people"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:01.409",
    "end": "00:02:05.163",
    "start_seconds": 121.409,
    "end_seconds": 125.163,
    "text": "through their local government, either city or region or state."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:05.163",
    "end": "00:02:09.709",
    "start_seconds": 125.163,
    "end_seconds": 129.709,
    "text": "Every time you buy something, like a cup of coffee,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:09.709",
    "end": "00:02:13.672",
    "start_seconds": 129.709,
    "end_seconds": 133.672,
    "text": "a portion of that tax will go to your city and your state."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:13.672",
    "end": "00:02:17.801",
    "start_seconds": 133.672,
    "end_seconds": 137.801,
    "text": "So we're using the money that we already generate that belongs to us."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:17.842",
    "end": "00:02:21.179",
    "start_seconds": 137.84199999999998,
    "end_seconds": 141.179,
    "text": "They don't have shareholders to pay."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:21.179",
    "end": "00:02:24.182",
    "start_seconds": 141.179,
    "end_seconds": 144.182,
    "text": "So as loans are repaid, it comes back into a public bank."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:24.182",
    "end": "00:02:28.353",
    "start_seconds": 144.182,
    "end_seconds": 148.353,
    "text": "Its mission is to support the local economic development"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:28.353",
    "end": "00:02:29.896",
    "start_seconds": 148.353,
    "end_seconds": 149.89600000000002,
    "text": "of the community it serves."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:29.938",
    "end": "00:02:32.273",
    "start_seconds": 149.938,
    "end_seconds": 152.273,
    "text": "That would be designed at a local level."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:32.273",
    "end": "00:02:36.069",
    "start_seconds": 152.273,
    "end_seconds": 156.06900000000002,
    "text": "So the law that we created -- the California Public Banking Act --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:36.069",
    "end": "00:02:39.114",
    "start_seconds": 156.06900000000002,
    "end_seconds": 159.114,
    "text": "created the legal framework for cities and municipalities"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:39.114",
    "end": "00:02:40.824",
    "start_seconds": 159.114,
    "end_seconds": 160.824,
    "text": "to be able to form their own banks."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:40.865",
    "end": "00:02:45.245",
    "start_seconds": 160.865,
    "end_seconds": 165.245,
    "text": "And so the mission of the bank, the mandates, the lending priorities,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:45.286",
    "end": "00:02:48.206",
    "start_seconds": 165.286,
    "end_seconds": 168.20600000000002,
    "text": "the investment priorities, the capitalization strategies,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:48.248",
    "end": "00:02:50.333",
    "start_seconds": 168.248,
    "end_seconds": 170.333,
    "text": "all the details of how this is going to work"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:50.333",
    "end": "00:02:53.128",
    "start_seconds": 170.333,
    "end_seconds": 173.128,
    "text": "is going to be defined at a local level."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:53.878",
    "end": "00:02:58.174",
    "start_seconds": 173.878,
    "end_seconds": 178.174,
    "text": "There are 900 public banks globally"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:58.216",
    "end": "00:03:01.010",
    "start_seconds": 178.216,
    "end_seconds": 181.01,
    "text": "with nearly $50 trillion in assets."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:01.052",
    "end": "00:03:04.222",
    "start_seconds": 181.052,
    "end_seconds": 184.222,
    "text": "In Germany, a network of 400 municipal banks"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:04.222",
    "end": "00:03:08.727",
    "start_seconds": 184.222,
    "end_seconds": 188.727,
    "text": "was able to support the country's renewable energy transition."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:08.727",
    "end": "00:03:12.355",
    "start_seconds": 188.727,
    "end_seconds": 192.355,
    "text": "In the United States, we have a successful model to emulate."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:12.397",
    "end": "00:03:13.773",
    "start_seconds": 192.397,
    "end_seconds": 193.773,
    "text": "The Bank of North Dakota"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:13.815",
    "end": "00:03:18.153",
    "start_seconds": 193.815,
    "end_seconds": 198.153,
    "text": "is a 100-year-old public bank founded in 1919."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:18.153",
    "end": "00:03:20.989",
    "start_seconds": 198.153,
    "end_seconds": 200.989,
    "text": "It was started by socialist farmers"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:21.030",
    "end": "00:03:26.077",
    "start_seconds": 201.03,
    "end_seconds": 206.077,
    "text": "who were being gouged by out-of-state New York bankers."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:26.077",
    "end": "00:03:27.454",
    "start_seconds": 206.077,
    "end_seconds": 207.454,
    "text": "During the Great Depression,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:27.454",
    "end": "00:03:31.666",
    "start_seconds": 207.454,
    "end_seconds": 211.666,
    "text": "nearly 200,000 farms were being foreclosed on."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:31.708",
    "end": "00:03:34.294",
    "start_seconds": 211.708,
    "end_seconds": 214.29399999999998,
    "text": "Because the state of North Dakota had a public bank,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:34.335",
    "end": "00:03:37.922",
    "start_seconds": 214.335,
    "end_seconds": 217.922,
    "text": "it was able to step in and buy the farms"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:37.964",
    "end": "00:03:40.592",
    "start_seconds": 217.964,
    "end_seconds": 220.59199999999998,
    "text": "and lend it back to the families for a dollar."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:41.092",
    "end": "00:03:44.262",
    "start_seconds": 221.09199999999998,
    "end_seconds": 224.262,
    "text": "Once the families were able to stabilize,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:44.262",
    "end": "00:03:48.057",
    "start_seconds": 224.262,
    "end_seconds": 228.05700000000002,
    "text": "they sold it back at a price they could afford."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:48.099",
    "end": "00:03:49.601",
    "start_seconds": 228.099,
    "end_seconds": 229.601,
    "text": "For the last century,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:49.642",
    "end": "00:03:52.312",
    "start_seconds": 229.642,
    "end_seconds": 232.312,
    "text": "it has supported local economic development,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:52.353",
    "end": "00:03:55.106",
    "start_seconds": 232.353,
    "end_seconds": 235.106,
    "text": "supported small businesses, infrastructure"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:55.106",
    "end": "00:03:59.944",
    "start_seconds": 235.106,
    "end_seconds": 239.94400000000002,
    "text": "while still returning very healthy return on equity, 15 to 18 percent."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:00.445",
    "end": "00:04:03.156",
    "start_seconds": 240.445,
    "end_seconds": 243.156,
    "text": "That means it's returning hundreds of millions of dollars"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:03.156",
    "end": "00:04:06.242",
    "start_seconds": 243.156,
    "end_seconds": 246.242,
    "text": "back into the general fund year after year."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:06.785",
    "end": "00:04:10.663",
    "start_seconds": 246.785,
    "end_seconds": 250.663,
    "text": "So that's an example of how a public bank is able to step in and support"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:10.705",
    "end": "00:04:13.082",
    "start_seconds": 250.705,
    "end_seconds": 253.082,
    "text": "and strengthen the community"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:13.124",
    "end": "00:04:16.461",
    "start_seconds": 253.124,
    "end_seconds": 256.461,
    "text": "without focusing on just purely profit."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:16.503",
    "end": "00:04:20.423",
    "start_seconds": 256.503,
    "end_seconds": 260.423,
    "text": "Los Angeles just dealt with a devastating wildfire."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:20.423",
    "end": "00:04:21.758",
    "start_seconds": 260.423,
    "end_seconds": 261.758,
    "text": "So if we had a public bank,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:21.758",
    "end": "00:04:26.387",
    "start_seconds": 261.758,
    "end_seconds": 266.387,
    "text": "it would have been able to step in to offer immediate, low-cost loans."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:26.429",
    "end": "00:04:30.934",
    "start_seconds": 266.429,
    "end_seconds": 270.934,
    "text": "It's able to be immediately responsive to the needs of the community"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:30.934",
    "end": "00:04:33.561",
    "start_seconds": 270.934,
    "end_seconds": 273.561,
    "text": "without having to wait for federal aid,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:33.603",
    "end": "00:04:36.481",
    "start_seconds": 273.603,
    "end_seconds": 276.481,
    "text": "which can be unstable."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:36.481",
    "end": "00:04:39.484",
    "start_seconds": 276.481,
    "end_seconds": 279.484,
    "text": "We're moving towards building a system"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:39.526",
    "end": "00:04:44.697",
    "start_seconds": 279.526,
    "end_seconds": 284.697,
    "text": "that mobilizes public revenue to support our public priorities."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:44.739",
    "end": "00:04:48.034",
    "start_seconds": 284.739,
    "end_seconds": 288.034,
    "text": "We've seen such an incredible amount of progress"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:48.076",
    "end": "00:04:49.369",
    "start_seconds": 288.076,
    "end_seconds": 289.369,
    "text": "in such a short time,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:49.410",
    "end": "00:04:54.332",
    "start_seconds": 289.40999999999997,
    "end_seconds": 294.332,
    "text": "because even without a complex understanding of finance and banking,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:54.332",
    "end": "00:04:56.709",
    "start_seconds": 294.332,
    "end_seconds": 296.709,
    "text": "when you start explaining public banking,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:56.709",
    "end": "00:05:01.130",
    "start_seconds": 296.709,
    "end_seconds": 301.13,
    "text": "it makes sense on a logical, intuitive level."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:01.172",
    "end": "00:05:04.384",
    "start_seconds": 301.172,
    "end_seconds": 304.384,
    "text": "Multiple cities and states are working towards it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:04.384",
    "end": "00:05:07.095",
    "start_seconds": 304.384,
    "end_seconds": 307.095,
    "text": "We have the ability to create a new system."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:07.136",
    "end": "00:05:10.306",
    "start_seconds": 307.136,
    "end_seconds": 310.306,
    "text": "This isn't a pie-in-the-sky idea."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:11.307",
    "end": "00:05:14.936",
    "start_seconds": 311.307,
    "end_seconds": 314.936,
    "text": "This is a model that works for the people,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:14.978",
    "end": "00:05:17.689",
    "start_seconds": 314.978,
    "end_seconds": 317.689,
    "text": "our communities and our environment."
  }
]
